-up: 958 sqft\nL174: * 3 Bedrooms + 2 Bathrooms\nL175: * Sell with tenancy: Tenanted until March 2027\nL176: * Parking: 2 Bays, Tandem\nL177: * Condition: Fully Fitted\nL178: * Included: 4 units Air-Conditioning, Kitchen Cabinet Fitted\nL179: Selling Price: RM568,000 ONLY (Below Market Value!)\nL180: Multiple units available for sale/rent — feel free to contact us for more options.\nL181: Facilities:\nL182: * 24-Hour Security\nL183: * Swimming Pool\nL184: * Gymnasium\nL185: * Playground\nL186: * Multipurpose Hall\nL187: Contact:\nL188: Richard Lee\nL189: 017*613*5859\nL190: (Call / WhatsApp / SMS)\nL191: One-stop legal and property advisory services provided. Owners are welcome to approach for property listing.\nL192: ##### Kemudahan\nL193: \nL194: cite64†Image: balcony-o†cdn.pgimgs.com L195: \nL196: Balkoni\nL197: \nL198: cite65†Image: bbq-o†cdn.pgimgs.com L199: \nL200: Barbecue pavilion\nL201: \nL202: cite65†Image: bbq-o†cdn.pgimgs.com L203: \nL204: Barbecue pits\nL205: \nL206: cite66†Image: asterisk-o†cdn.pgimgs.com L207: \nL208: Bilik permainan\nL209: \nL210: Lihat semua 25 kemudahan\nL211: \nL212: ##### Kemudahan bersama\nL213: \nL214: cite65†Image: bbq-o†cdn.pgimgs.com L215: \nL216: Bbq\nL217: \nL218: cite67†Image: badminton-o†cdn.pgimgs.com L219: \nL220: Dewan badminton\nL221: \nL222: cite68†Image: shared-space-o†cdn.pgimgs.com L223: \nL224: Dewan serbaguna\nL225: \nL226: cite69†Image: gym-o†cdn.pgimgs.com L227: \nL228: Gim\nL229: \nL230: Lihat semua 13 fasiliti\nL231: ## Kemampuan\nL232: \nL233: Mampukah saya membeli hartanah ini?\nL234: \nL235: Beritahu kami pendapatan dan perbelanjaan bulanan anda untuk melihat sama ada rumah ini sesuai dengan bajet anda.\nL236: \nL237: Semak kemampuan\nL238: \nL239: Perincian Pinjaman Gadai Janji\nL240: \nL241: Anggaran Bayaran Balik Bulanan\nL242: \nL243: RM 0 / bulanan\nL244: \nL245: 0%\nL246: \nL247: 0%\nL248: \nL249: RM 0 Prinsipal\nL250: \nL251: RM 0 Faedah\nL252: \nL253: Kos Pendahuluan\nL254