 accessible using Federal Highway, Damansara-Puchong Highway (LDP), New Klang Valley Expressway (NKVE), Penchala Link and SPRINT Highways. It takes approximately 15 minutes’ drive from TTDI to KL Sentral and around 20 minutes to the Subang Skypark Terminal. The property is also next to the upcoming Taman Tun Dr. Ismail MRT station. Besides, residents can easily get taxis within the neighbourhood too.\nL281: Shopping malls nearby are Empire City Mall, GLO Damansara, Tropicana City Mall and 1Utama Shopping Centre. Supermarkets and hypermarkets nearby include Ben’s Independent Grocer, Hero Supermarket at TTDI Plaza, AEON Big, Cold Storage, AEON Supermarket and Tesco Extra. TTDI Ascencia is very near to the commercial area of TTDI. There are shophouses occupied by banks, food operators, phone service providers and private clinics.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nNoora @ Desa ParkCity - Disclaimer (https://www.noora.com.my/disclaimer.html)\nciteturn378view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.noora.com.my/disclaimer.html\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 26\n"
